\item OpenAI, \emph{Path selection and an elliptic inequality on degenerating Ricci-flat trees}, 2026-09-24; citation key \texttt{OAI:Path-selection-and-an-elliptic-inequality-on-degenerating-Ricci-flat-trees-September-24-2026}. \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Path-selection-and-an-elliptic-inequality-on-degenerating-Ricci-flat-trees-September-24-2026/paper.pdf}{PDF (GitHub)}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/raw/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Path-selection-and-an-elliptic-inequality-on-degenerating-Ricci-flat-trees-September-24-2026/paper.pdf}{PDF (direct)}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Path-selection-and-an-elliptic-inequality-on-degenerating-Ricci-flat-trees-September-24-2026/README.md}{Manuscript page and citation}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/main/preprints/Path-selection-and-an-elliptic-inequality-on-degenerating-Ricci-flat-trees-September-24-2026/paper.pdf}{Latest version}.
